# EmailJS Configuration
# Get these from https://www.emailjs.com/

# 1. Public Key - Dashboard → Integration → Public Key
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_public_key_here

# 2. Service ID - Email Services → Your Service → Service ID
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_service_id_here

# 3. Template ID - Email Templates → Your Template → Template ID
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_template_id_here

# ============================================
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# ============================================
# 
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local
# 2. Replace the values with your actual EmailJS credentials
# 3. Restart dev server (npm run dev)
# 4. Test the contact form
#
# If you get a 400 error:
# - Verify all three credentials are correct and not placeholders
# - Make sure your email template field names match the form:
#   - name
#   - email
#   - subject
#   - message
# - Check EmailJS dashboard for any account issues
#
